{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O3: Hollow Descent</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>top-down rogue-like shooter</strong> set in a dark, biomechanical sci-fi world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone astronaut descending into a hostile alien planet, fighting room by room through shifting labyrinths filled with traps, creatures, and escalating threats. Combat is precise and dodge-focused, built around quick dashes, reactive shooting, and randomized weapons that reshape your build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is different.<br>Each death is part of the loop.<br>Push deeper. Learn faster. Return stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the haunting atmosphere of H. R. Giger and Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski, O3 blends oppressive sci-fi environments with tight, skill-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.poster.avif?t=1771934081\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.webm?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/24653d9588653e09cb623f66a84cc16d.mp4?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/8eb3028a4b10548f3704571f6c1da57c.webp?t=1771934081\" width=600 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated rooms reshape every run.<br>Navigate arena-style encounters, avoid deadly traps, and adapt to new layouts as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.poster.avif?t=1771934081\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.webm?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/f738f98da17d625ace928020535c5b54.mp4?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/7dea648af91537ea9b69af5e3ad60561.webp?t=1771934081\" width=600 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense bullet-hell combat using fast dashes and responsive shooting.<br>Master enemy patterns and clear each room to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.poster.avif?t=1771934081\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.webm?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/daedacf4320ec27d458ff5203d0efc77.mp4?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/8f059cc62fa452ca625e04178017a5eb.webp?t=1771934081\" width=600 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapons and a range of active and passive abilities that shape your build each run.<br>Break into hidden rooms, open secret chests, and uncover rewards hidden beyond the obvious path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.poster.avif?t=1771934081\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.webm?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/extras/32bdfcc5db5fba39fb86615b1731b09a.mp4?t=1771934081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2528960?t=1771934081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2528960?t=1771934081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/2dc4f3ee52671ac98ba03042b2365da690a7aa2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771934081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528960/2dc4f3ee52671ac98ba03042b2365da690a7aa2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771934081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3782050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O3: Hollow Descent</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>top-down rogue-like shooter</strong> set in a dark, biomechanical sci-fi world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone astronaut descending into a hostile alien planet, fighting room by room through shifting labyrinth